    hint: did you mean opening?
    fix: 32:11 "openning" -> "opening"
  37:65: error: no scenario named "bse" to inherit from
    hint: did you mean base?
    fix: 37:65 "\"bse\"" -> "\"base\""
  43:81: error: scenario "base" has no step "tow" to inherit up to
    hint: did you mean two?
    fix: 43:81 "tow" -> "two"
  49:1: warning: view "detail" is declared but nothing clicks through to it
  52:9: error: "clint" is not a node in this diagram
    hint: did you mean client?
    fix: 52:9 "clint" -> "client"
  53:21: error: no view named "detial" is declared
    hint: did you mean detail?
    fix: 53:21 "detial" -> "detail"
